    <div class="bg-surface-container rounded-xl border border-surface-container-high p-8 space-y-8 text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-headline font-bold text-xl text-on-surface mb-3">1. Overview</h2>
        <p>FullOnBaan offers digital training products including eBooks, video course bundles, and combo packages. Because these are digital goods that are delivered electronically, our cancellation and refund policy is as described below. Every product we sell is covered by our <strong class="text-on-surface">7-Day Money-Back Guarantee</strong>, subject to the fair-use conditions below.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-headline font-bold text-xl text-on-surface mb-3">2. Order Cancellation</h2>
        <p>Once a payment is successfully processed and the digital product has been dispatched to your registered email address, the order cannot be cancelled. If you have not yet received your product and wish to cancel, please contact us within <strong class="text-on-surface">2 hours</strong> of placing the order at <a href="mailto:fullonbaan@gmail.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">fullonbaan@gmail.com</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-headline font-bold text-xl text-on-surface mb-3">3. 7-Day Money-Back Guarantee</h2>
        <p class="mb-2">Every FullOnBaan product is covered — individual eBooks, video courses, combo packages, strategy kits, the Full eBook Library and the Full Video Library.</p>
        <p class="mb-2">If a product does not meet your expectations, email us within <strong class="text-on-surface">7 days</strong> of the purchase date with your order reference and a brief reason, and we will refund the amount you paid, subject to the fair-use conditions in Section 4. We encourage you to read the free preview chapter before buying so you know exactly what you are getting.</p>
        <p>Separately, you are always entitled to a refund if you were charged but did not receive the product within 48 hours of confirmed payment, or if you were charged more than once for the same order due to a technical error.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-headline font-bold text-xl text-on-surface mb-3">4. Fair-Use Conditions</h2>
        <p class="mb-2">Because our products are downloadable and cannot be returned, the guarantee is offered in good faith and on these conditions:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 ml-2">
          <li><strong class="text-on-surface">One refund per customer.</strong> The guarantee can be used once per person, identified by name, email address, phone number or payment method. Later purchases by the same customer are not eligible.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-on-surface">Licence ends on refund.</strong> When a refund is issued, your licence to use the material ends. You must delete all copies (including printed copies) and confirm this by email, and any certificate-exam access or certificate obtained with that purchase is cancelled.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-on-surface">Bundles are refunded as a whole.</strong> Combo packages, strategy kits and the Full eBook / Video Libraries are refunded in full or not at all; individual items cannot be kept from a refunded bundle.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-on-surface">No refund where misuse is found.</strong> We may decline a refund, and withdraw access, if we have reasonable evidence that the material has been shared, uploaded, resold or otherwise distributed in breach of our <a href="/terms/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>, or of a pattern of buying and refunding (including through multiple accounts).</li>
          <li><strong class="text-on-surface">Time limit.</strong> Requests made more than 7 days after the purchase date are not eligible, except for the non-delivery and duplicate-charge cases in Section 3.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-2">Every copy of our material is licensed to the individual buyer. Sharing or using material after a refund is a breach of our Terms &amp; Conditions and of FullOnBaan's copyright, and we reserve the right to take appropriate action.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-headline font-bold text-xl text-on-surface mb-3">5. How to Request a Refund</h2>
        <p class="mb-2">To initiate a refund request, please email us at <a href="mailto:fullonbaan@gmail.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">fullonbaan@gmail.com</a> with the subject line <strong class="text-on-surface">"Refund Request — [Order Reference]"</strong> and include:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 ml-2">
          <li>Your full name and registered email address</li>
          <li>Payment reference / Razorpay transaction ID</li>
          <li>Reason for the refund request</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-2">We will review your request and respond within 3 business days.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-headline font-bold text-xl text-on-surface mb-3">6. Refund Processing</h2>
        <p>Approved refunds will be processed to the original payment method within <strong class="text-on-surface">5–7 business days</strong> after approval. The timeline may vary depending on your bank or payment provider. GST amounts included in the original payment will be refunded in full if the refund is approved.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-headline font-bold text-xl text-on-surface mb-3">7. Failed Payments</h2>
        <p>If your payment fails and your account is debited, the amount will be automatically reversed to your account within 5–7 business days by your bank or payment provider. If you do not receive the reversal, please contact us with your transaction details.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-headline font-bold text-xl text-on-surface mb-3">8. Contact</h2>
        <p>For cancellation or refund queries, contact us at <a href="mailto:fullonbaan@gmail.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">fullonbaan@gmail.com</a> or +91 63605 93122. You can also visit our <a href="/contact/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Contact page</a>.</p>
